#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:1 d5a9b2858b3e4e4e90d7a868d8f307a9
msgid "Stats glossary"
msgstr "统计指标词汇表"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:3 682665cecc364009aa8146b37b5a04bb
msgid ""
"`Backtest.show_stats()` and `qtrade.utils.stats.calculate_stats()` print "
"a dict with ~25 metrics. This page explains what each one means, how it's"
" computed, and a rough guide to interpretation."
msgstr ""
"`Backtest.show_stats()` 和 `qtrade.utils.stats.calculate_stats()` 输出 ~25 个指标。"
"本页解释每个指标的含义、计算方式以及粗略的判断标准。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:7 8121dc31ef414ac69e5f00e8c58ff513
msgid ""
"For per-asset breakdowns in a portfolio backtest, see "
"`calculate_stats_per_asset(broker)` — it returns the trade-level subset "
"of these metrics keyed by asset symbol."
msgstr ""
"组合回测的按资产细分见 `calculate_stats_per_asset(broker)` —— 返回这些指标里"
"交易级别那部分，以资产代码为键。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:11 25121fd447054966bc162a81b2ebff2e
msgid "Time / value"
msgstr "时间 / 净值"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 1362cbb8ab00425d843968809e62c7eb
#: 32d87a7121c646ecacfc9b488095ba25 6b6f277b4dbb43c5ab1978b0f63735f0
#: 999ca4bb61594c5389752e2c28256512
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "指标"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 53518fcf1a634aeab665bf59189de6a9
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md d9c4015efc7a4c9aaf4fe504ab5a4e12
msgid "**Start**"
msgstr "**Start**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 49d247e7b0b04899a4fe9180a750e25e
msgid "First bar timestamp (from `equity_history.index[0]`)."
msgstr "首根 bar 的时间戳（取自 `equity_history.index[0]`）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 39d9d0224e814c0fa63e4ef53bc6fa9d
msgid "**End**"
msgstr "**End**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 696a7f785def4a22ae60dee2e720f0b4
msgid "Last bar processed (`broker.current_time`)."
msgstr "最后一根处理过的 bar（`broker.current_time`）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 2241b24ecf3d44c8b76ae63b68ff4dea
msgid "**Duration**"
msgstr "**Duration**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 376ea2487d354d4783418cdb1a1651f5
msgid "`End - Start` as a `pd.Timedelta`."
msgstr "`End - Start`，类型为 `pd.Timedelta`。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 43c9879918b94080ba329c2a4225408c
msgid "**Start Value**"
msgstr "**Start Value**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 3690b6c47c56499d94366dae008c2820
msgid "Initial equity (typically equal to starting cash)."
msgstr "初始净值（通常等于起始现金）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 6dc590fe31414082a5273002bd36ce60
msgid "**End Value**"
msgstr "**End Value**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md de073460e041437099d9ab85657e546e
msgid "Equity at the end of the backtest."
msgstr "回测结束时的净值。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:21 ea994b906615457589d87dd70e935819
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "收益"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 5b06dc2a8b894fba9e4f5a953dd9b0a1
#: c3c4fbdaafc140fba479a49a3b646798
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 3a4c7e50086f463db2973644ce9430e9
#: dae8b13e588b4704be14dae72d7b2ada edea0542e1194a889b3912f79d48b61d
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md a22b82eda4e74519b193512e9f6b6e69
msgid "**Total Return [%]**"
msgstr "**Total Return [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md fc77ca93505343dd8c27dbe52a261881
msgid "`(End - Start) / Start × 100`"
msgstr "`(End - Start) / Start × 100`"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 8fbba21016c149979c2363a5a37fb1e2
msgid "Raw, not annualized."
msgstr "原始值，未年化。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 2451b699590b42c885e6489736fb3ddb
msgid "**Total Commission Cost[%]**"
msgstr "**Total Commission Cost[%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 09f9e4add18543378c3a4571269ab84c
msgid "Sum of all commissions paid over the run"
msgstr "整个回测中支付的所有佣金总和"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 34fe60fb3e0045288694e7f1f4e51181
msgid "Helpful for spotting strategies that bleed on fees."
msgstr "便于识别被手续费拖死的策略。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 5633b82779a746ac80fb845d23bb5f4d
msgid "**Buy & Hold Return [%]**"
msgstr "**Buy & Hold Return [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 3075e2b2f56a4f9cb0312505410c911a
msgid ""
"`(close[-1] - close[0]) / close[0] × 100` for the asset (single) or "
"**equal-weighted average** across assets (multi)"
msgstr ""
"单资产时为 `(close[-1] - close[0]) / close[0] × 100`；"
"多资产时为各资产的**等权平均**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 355cc261e29b4a5982ceeae8271af89f
msgid ""
"Benchmark to beat. Strategies losing to B&H typically aren't worth "
"running over passive holding."
msgstr ""
"需要击败的基准。跑不赢 Buy & Hold 的策略通常不如被动持有。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 04f42439697a456fad1cc8f6a5f55a9e
msgid "**Return (Ann.) [%]**"
msgstr "**Return (Ann.) [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md bc969c58ac6e4ec5bf6a1dd9b8e9ef85
msgid ""
"Geometric mean of daily returns, annualized to 252 (stocks) or 365 "
"(crypto/FX) days"
msgstr ""
"日收益率的几何平均，按 252（股票）或 365（加密 / 外汇）天年化"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 58b011a0399b4f158ce3a1f04d13827b
msgid "Compounded annual growth rate."
msgstr "复合年增长率（CAGR）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md ddb6c357743e481c88b6d5969a4ee64b
msgid "**Volatility (Ann.) [%]**"
msgstr "**Volatility (Ann.) [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 8533da1a5e9047778b85642f7f64ada5
msgid "`std(daily_returns) × √annual_days × 100`"
msgstr "`std(daily_returns) × √annual_days × 100`"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 61df3f824acf499ea8fdc52a019ace49
msgid "Standard deviation of returns, scaled to a year."
msgstr "收益率的标准差，按年缩放。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:31 1fe90f2a3d264ddf8bf2b042dc645230
msgid ""
"The 252 vs 365 annualization factor is auto-detected: if the equity curve"
" includes weekends as trading days (`>≈ 60%` of weekend bars are filled),"
" it's treated as 365-day; otherwise 252."
msgstr ""
"252 / 365 年化因子自动检测：如果净值曲线把周末当作交易日（≥ 60% 的周末 bar 有数据），"
"按 365 天年化；否则按 252。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:35 861ced3cb2754aa79ac92fd6ee169e8b
msgid "Risk"
msgstr "风险"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md dbb58f8a74454eed864d153ef42fab3e
msgid "**Max Drawdown [%]**"
msgstr "**Max Drawdown [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 80fdaae3cbec43bcb3801a9ca20210ee
msgid "`min((equity - cummax(equity)) / cummax(equity)) × 100`"
msgstr "`min((equity - cummax(equity)) / cummax(equity)) × 100`"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 17c438c41ed34374862b91ccd9548563
msgid "The biggest peak-to-trough decline. Always ≤ 0."
msgstr "最大峰谷跌幅，恒 ≤ 0。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 993e2ab687584d71b940a12bead71674
msgid "**Max Drawdown Duration**"
msgstr "**Max Drawdown Duration**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md b5dfafac091642e49c31b41e55c4b562
msgid "Length of the longest contiguous \"below peak\" period"
msgstr "最长连续「在峰值之下」的时间段长度"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md dbc88846db664df6a71d23ac23821439
msgid ""
"Returned as a `pd.Timedelta`. The drawdown that took longest to recover "
"from, not the deepest one."
msgstr ""
"返回 `pd.Timedelta`。是恢复期最长的回撤，不是最深的那次。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:42 6111b5afa23f442d87762a450d2d921f
msgid "Trade statistics"
msgstr "交易统计"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 2cc1fd5222a24518a82b3b81890822d1
msgid "**Total Trades**"
msgstr "**Total Trades**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 03772b06cecd4d8591b85016a73140e7
msgid "Count of closed trades across all assets."
msgstr "所有资产已平仓交易总数。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 9fd86759bc7745e586671f98d32441e7
msgid "**Win Rate [%]**"
msgstr "**Win Rate [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 1f969389027741efbf9ed3dd31695efa
msgid "Percentage of closed trades with positive profit."
msgstr "盈利交易占已平仓交易的百分比。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md f65fcd1f01a84b89913b4c50fcd2d4a3
msgid "**Best Trade [%]**"
msgstr "**Best Trade [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 4f38ec9f6bf24872a684444d23249775
msgid ""
"Largest single trade profit (in account currency, not %). The label says "
"\"[%]\" for legacy reasons — it's a P&L value."
msgstr ""
"单笔最大盈利（账户币种，不是百分比）。标签写「[%]」是历史遗留 —— 实际是绝对盈亏值。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 361afb4cf72940fc8d22a9fc331d2d65
msgid "**Worst Trade [%]**"
msgstr "**Worst Trade [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 70f17ed7c3b245c7a7e56d6deb8bd591
msgid "Same, but the most negative profit."
msgstr "同上，但取最负盈亏。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 819dcd6a6f474d01a69e99bcb12625ca
msgid "**Avg Winning Trade [%]**"
msgstr "**Avg Winning Trade [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md e06339c0647d421fa261a1a5bf33e218
msgid "Mean profit of winning trades."
msgstr "盈利交易的平均盈利。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 331d5096724347119edfb5b9ce83595c
msgid "**Avg Losing Trade [%]**"
msgstr "**Avg Losing Trade [%]**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md e0590b93f6d14efaa547d54a77be46ee
msgid "Mean profit of losing trades (negative)."
msgstr "亏损交易的平均盈亏（负值）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 0f430f343c5242d19e1bb22e011b7592
msgid "**Avg Winning Trade Duration**"
msgstr "**Avg Winning Trade Duration**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md 2bfc19d6075449578f26a859233d8935
msgid "Mean time-in-market for winners."
msgstr "盈利交易的平均持仓时长。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md e151c1f5d6bd400a883abf32e18950c0
msgid "**Avg Losing Trade Duration**"
msgstr "**Avg Losing Trade Duration**"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md fce0863e03964532958f78c9a8afeff3
msgid "Mean time-in-market for losers."
msgstr "亏损交易的平均持仓时长。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:55 c5f5091055344b8bb143bc1011d6f012
msgid ""
"If \"winners hold longer than losers\" you have a \"let winners run, cut "
"losers short\" pattern. Reverse means you're cutting winners early."
msgstr ""
"如果「赢家持仓时间更长」，说明你有「让利润奔跑，及时止损」的模式。反过来则是过早砍掉赢家。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:58 a277ac0b592c441a81f09c66d8cde797
msgid "Performance ratios"
msgstr "绩效比率"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:60 a3380b8b2e124a88ad621fde13397b05
msgid ""
"These compress return-and-risk into a single number. Different ratios "
"penalize different things."
msgstr ""
"这些把收益和风险压缩成一个单一数字。不同比率惩罚的对象不一样。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:63 c82c68660603494faca5e0677954b8a9
msgid "Profit Factor"
msgstr "Profit Factor（盈亏比）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:69 49d8709f0b2145fc8cb0895786b6c37b
msgid ""
"Higher is better. > 1 means you're net positive. > 2 is rare and good. "
"NaN if there are no losing trades."
msgstr ""
"越高越好。> 1 说明净盈利。> 2 比较少见且优秀。无亏损交易时为 NaN。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:72 2eaea16122b94a52b4061fe3e351e425
msgid "Expectancy"
msgstr "Expectancy（期望值）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:78 da33ce6c1b704c1b91e62fd3e45ec0c6
msgid ""
"Average dollar profit per trade. Positive expectancy means each trade is "
"worth taking on average."
msgstr ""
"每笔交易的平均盈亏（账户币种）。正期望值意味着平均而言每笔交易都值得做。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:81 39adcafa98da4e3eb59844d3dbcb4bcd
msgid "Sharpe Ratio"
msgstr "Sharpe Ratio（夏普比率）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:87 49a2d51c003f46c2bb81342c61f7b49e
msgid ""
"Risk-free rate is assumed to be 0 (override by editing "
"`__calculate_performance_ratios` in `stats.py` if you need otherwise). "
"Rough guide:"
msgstr ""
"无风险利率默认为 0（如需调整，编辑 `stats.py` 里的 "
"`__calculate_performance_ratios`）。粗略判断："

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:91 5eab923c2fb249bdae31eceb7856f673
msgid "**< 0**: losing strategy."
msgstr "**< 0**：亏损策略。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:92 122a6696e5de4b54a5e6fc835912351a
msgid "**0–1**: marginal; might be in-sample noise."
msgstr "**0–1**：勉强；可能只是样本内的噪声。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:93 2de898c07b5c49f3b0cbb08ccf09eb9f
msgid "**1–2**: solid."
msgstr "**1–2**：扎实。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:94 76315288351a44078d070996f3701a2d
msgid ""
"**> 2**: excellent (and usually too good — check for overfitting or look-"
"ahead bias)."
msgstr ""
"**> 2**：优秀（通常好得不像真的 —— 检查是否过拟合或未来函数）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:97 6602d92a78f34c778505cd8b6d50660b
msgid "Sortino Ratio"
msgstr "Sortino Ratio（索提诺比率）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:103 0f9012ccc63646d8912ddaa6f3fe4caa
msgid ""
"Like Sharpe, but only penalizes downside volatility. Strategies with "
"asymmetric return distributions (most positive trend-followers) score "
"better here than on Sharpe."
msgstr ""
"和 Sharpe 类似，但只惩罚下行波动。收益分布非对称的策略（多数趋势跟随）"
"在这里比 Sharpe 表现更好。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:107 a090432bd0c44a009870c20892e4e6fc
msgid "Calmar Ratio"
msgstr "Calmar Ratio（卡玛比率）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:113 72b5067ccfbe432597f4fe038ac2d51e
msgid ""
"How much annual return per unit of worst-case drawdown. > 1 is decent "
"(your annual gains exceed your worst dip)."
msgstr ""
"每单位最坏回撤换来多少年化收益。> 1 算不错（年收益超过最大回撤）。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:116 f64088400fd546d98b71567244a403c1
msgid "Omega Ratio"
msgstr "Omega Ratio（Omega 比率）"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:122 30deb27018a74a8eab0a49d7dc94b69f
msgid ""
"Threshold is 0 (so: gains divided by losses, summed across all daily "
"return observations). Captures the full distribution of returns rather "
"than mean/std summary. > 1 is positive."
msgstr ""
"阈值为 0（即所有日收益样本中，盈利之和除以亏损之和）。捕捉收益的完整分布，"
"而非均值 / 标准差摘要。> 1 即为正。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:126 8a0824c8633345d3965b2c6da3fd031c
msgid "Sanity-checking your stats"
msgstr "对统计结果的合理性检查"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:128 9d685e63bf4743b7b7b6e680d7269c19
msgid "A few things to verify before getting excited about a backtest:"
msgstr "在为回测结果兴奋之前先验证几件事："

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:130 3af2eee1313d4e20b5afb6eff011e1f2
msgid ""
"**Total Trades is reasonable** — single-digit trade counts can produce "
"Sharpe = 5 by accident. You want enough trades for the metrics to be "
"statistically meaningful."
msgstr ""
"**总交易数合理** —— 个位数的交易数可能偶然产生 Sharpe = 5。"
"你需要足够多的交易让指标在统计上有意义。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:133 7d9d118b020d4507954229635a9448e0
msgid ""
"**Total Return > Buy & Hold** — beating B&H is the bar. Losing to it on a"
" long-only strategy means your timing is hurting more than helping."
msgstr ""
"**Total Return > Buy & Hold** —— 跑赢 B&H 是底线。"
"纯多头策略输给 B&H 说明你的择时帮倒忙。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:135 9d79f573c7784cf9a7bba7cde7ccce64
msgid ""
"**Win Rate × Avg Win > (1 - Win Rate) × |Avg Loss|** — the basic "
"expectancy condition. If this fails, your strategy is structurally "
"losing."
msgstr ""
"**胜率 × 均赢 > (1 − 胜率) × |均亏|** —— 基本期望值条件。不满足说明策略结构性亏损。"

#: ../guide/stats_glossary.md:138 e6f534abcdc841aea216d2126abe80ba
msgid ""
"**Use `walk_forward_optimize` before trusting `optimize` results** — in-"
"sample Sharpe is almost always too high. See [Walk-forward "
"optimization](walk_forward.md)."
msgstr ""
"**信任 `optimize` 结果前先跑 `walk_forward_optimize`** —— 样本内 Sharpe 基本都偏高。"
"详见 [Walk-forward 优化](walk_forward.md)。"
